    "usageGuidance": {
      "do": [
        "建议：Use Lake Blue {#0072CE} for the primary CTA, active tab tint, calorie ring fill at \"on track\", and the diary FAB。",
        "建议：Use MFP Blue {#005DAA} for heritage moments — the logomark, Premium upsell gradient end, large nav title accents。",
        "建议：Keep the macro donut trio in the exact order Carbs Orange → Fat Purple → Protein Green; never reorder, never recolor。",
        "建议：Set tabular numerals on every number that summarizes nutrition — calories, grams, percentages, weight, water ounces。",
        "建议：Use the ring color-flip semantically: green when under, blue when on-track, amber when approaching, red when over。"
      ],
      "dont": [
        "避免：use the macro trio colors anywhere outside the macro context — orange should not appear on a button, purple should not appear on a tab。",
        "避免：render the calorie ring without tabular numerals — non-aligned digits make the giant number look broken。",
        "避免：use the Premium gold {#D4A437} as a primary CTA — it's a *gate*, not an action。",
        "避免：add aggressive shadows — MFP is clinical and flat; soft 4% shadows only。",
        "避免：break the meal section order (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Snacks) — this is the cultural pattern users expect。"
      ]
    },
